admin controls
├── caller lacks ADMIN_ROLE → revert for every control
├── swap, peg, or Yearn-loss value exceeds hard cap/order → revert
├── valid configuration → persist and emit
├── pause/emergency state → block deposits/claims but retain retrieval
├── rescue core/zero/invalid asset → revert
├── rescue non-core token → transfer exact amount
├── routine admin attempts YieldManager role grant or revoke → revert without changing access
└── upgrade authority rotates the role → new YieldManager gains and old YieldManager loses access
